    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Blueprint-facing wrapper around <ref refid="class_f_tryll_agent_variables" kindref="compound">FTryllAgentVariables</ref>. Returned by <ref refid="class_u_tryll_agent_component_1a048419ac43d7d4b1d67f1b19c8d2ad63" kindref="member">UTryllAgentComponent::GetVariables()</ref>; forwards typed setters/getters to the agent&apos;s C++ mirror. Reads are synchronous (served from the local mirror); writes are staged and flushed automatically before the next agent interaction. Setters return an <ref refid="struct_f_tryll_error" kindref="compound">FTryllError</ref> (Ok on success); an unknown name or type mismatch is rejected locally with no wire round-trip. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
